  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Trap. When Piercing Trap is triggered, all nearby foes are struck for 5...41...50 piercing damage. Any foes with Cracked Armor are struck for an additional 15...51...60 damage. Piercing Trap ends after 90 seconds. While activating this skill, you are easily interrupted.",
